n-gùn siṵ̄’tioh-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>챻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>챻 <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>當<rt>당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ài-jiéng’e chiâh-chiah boe-tàng-pàng-boe-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-ai’e ti-tô-wī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-bêh-kâh-lì siṵ-bêh-kâh-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>跳<rt>ᄐᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>챻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>챻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>챻\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lai-thiàu-chiâh-chiâh-chiah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-lì sī m-jāi-lì sī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>走去<rt>ᄌᅷˆ킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jâu-khì-tô-wī’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    앟 <ruby>飲<rt>림ˆ</rt></ruby>’롷킈 <ruby>飲<rt>림ˆ</rt></ruby>’롷킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ah lîm’loh-khi lîm’loh-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>通<rt>탕